  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p>This page is lists of all <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-custom-34195\" title=\"Decorations/Custom\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">custom-decoration</a> upgrades and their costs.\n</p>\n<div class=\"toc\"><div class=\"toctitle\"><h2>Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gardeners' Decoration</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Stonemasons' Decoration</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pedestal Decoration</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Yard Decoration</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\">Gardeners' Decoration</span></h2>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Upgrade\n</th>\n<th>Level 1\n</th>\n<th>Level 2\n</th>\n<th>Level 3\n</th>\n<th>Level 4\n</th>\n<th>Level 5\n</th>\n<th>Level 6\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Description\n</td>\n<td>Select a leaf color\n</td>\n<td>Select a trunk color\n</td>\n<td>Select a type of flower and then its color\n</td>\n<td>Select a border and then do its color\n</td>\n<td>Select decoration at the base and then do its color\n</td>\n<td>Select a style of tree decoration and then do its color\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>Green\n</td>\n<td>Brown\n</td>\n<td>Cheery flowers\n<ul><li>White</li>\n<li>Orange</li>\n<li>Pink</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Brick\n<ul><li>Grey</li>\n<li>White</li>\n<li>Brown</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Grass\n<ul><li>Green</li>\n<li>Golden</li>\n<li>Purple</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Paper lanterns\n<ul><li>White</li>\n<li>Magenta</li>\n<li>Blue</li>\n<li>Orange</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>Purple\n</td>\n<td>Reddish\n</td>\n<td>Jacaranda flowers\n<ul><li>Blue</li>\n<li>Orange</li>\n<li>White</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Stone\n<ul><li>White</li>\n<li>Orange</li>\n<li>Grey</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Pebbles\n<ul><li>Dark gray</li>\n<li>White</li>\n<li>Reddish</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Metal lanterns\n<ul><li>Black</li>\n<li>Bronze</li>\n<li>Gold</li>\n<li>Dark grey</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>Bright Green\n</td>\n<td>Greyish\n</td>\n<td>Magnolia flowers\n<ul><li>Magenta</li>\n<li>Yellow</li>\n<li>Pink</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Fence\n<ul><li>White</li>\n<li>Beige</li>\n<li>Brown</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Pansies\n<ul><li>Yellow</li>\n<li>Blue</li>\n<li>Purple</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Bird cages\n<ul><li>White</li>\n<li>Yellow</li>\n<li>Purple</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">Cost\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>3 <span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Blueprint.png/revision/latest?cb=20200428130230\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blueprint\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Blueprint.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20200428130230\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>5 <span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Blueprint.png/revision/latest?cb=20200428130230\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blueprint\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Blueprint.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20200428130230\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>7 <span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Blueprint.png/revision/latest?cb=20200428130230\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blueprint\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Blueprint.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20200428130230\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15,000<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\">Randomized in list: 85,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>, 150,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>, 250,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> ,100<span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Green voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>, 25<span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Blue voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>, 15 <span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Purple voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>, and 10<span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Golden voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> , and not be repeated\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\">Stonemasons' Decoration</span></h2>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Upgrade\n</th>\n<th>Level 1\n</th>\n<th>Level 2\n</th>\n<th>Level 3\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Level 4\n</th>\n<th>Level 5\n</th>\n<th>Level 6\n</th>\n<th>Level 7\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Description\n</td>\n<td>Select a stonemasonry\n</td>\n<td>Select a stonemasonry's color\n</td>\n<td>Select a color of the stonemasonry's elements\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Select a type of plant\n<p>and its color\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>Select a border\n<p>and  its color\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>Select  decoration at the base\n<p>and its color\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>Select an element for base decoration and its color\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>Pagoda\n</td>\n<td>Pagoda color\n<ul><li>White</li>\n<li>Dark grey</li>\n<li>Gold</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Divided floors\n<ul><li>White</li>\n<li>Dark grey</li>\n<li>Gold</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">Moss\n<ul><li>Bright green</li>\n<li>Golden</li>\n<li>Brown</li></ul>\n<p>Magnolia flowers\n</p>\n<ul><li>Pink</li>\n<li>Magenta</li>\n<li>Blue</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">Jacaranda flowers\n<ul><li>Pink</li>\n<li>Magenta</li>\n<li>Blue</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Stone\n<ul><li>Brown</li>\n<li>White</li>\n<li>Dark grey</li></ul>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>Pond\n<ul><li>Bright green</li>\n<li>Green</li>\n<li>Golden</li></ul>\n<p>(Color of aquatic plants)\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>For pond\n<ul><li>Koi fish</li>\n<li>Water Lilies</li>\n<li>Bamboo</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>Birdbath\n</td>\n<td>Birdbath color\n<ul><li>Dark grey</li>\n<li>Gold</li>\n<li>Green</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Bird doll\n<ul><li>Gold</li>\n<li>Silver</li>\n<li>Green</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Fence\n<ul><li>Dark grey</li>\n<li>Copper</li>\n<li>Bronze</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Mosaic\n<ul><li>Gold</li>\n<li>Dark grey</li>\n<li>Blue</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">For sand and mosaic\n<ul><li>Lantern</li>\n<li>Bamboo</li>\n<li>Stone</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>Fountain\n</td>\n<td>Fountain color\n<ul><li>Gold</li>\n<li>Brown</li>\n<li>Silver</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Rocks\n<ul><li>Dark grey</li>\n<li>Brown</li>\n<li>Grey</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Moss\n<ul><li>Bright green</li>\n<li>Golden</li>\n<li>Brown</li></ul>\n<p>Cheery flowers \n</p>\n<ul><li>White</li>\n<li>Pink</li>\n<li>Blue</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Mosaic\n<ul><li>Blue</li>\n<li>Dark grey</li>\n<li>Brown</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Sand\n<ul><li>White</li>\n<li>Beige</li>\n<li>Golden</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">Cost\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\">2 <span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Blueprint.png/revision/latest?cb=20200428130230\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blueprint\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>3 <span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Blueprint.png/revision/latest?cb=20200428130230\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blueprint\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>4 <span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Blueprint.png/revision/latest?cb=20200428130230\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blueprint\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>6 <span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Blueprint.png/revision/latest?cb=20200428130230\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blueprint\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\">Randomized in list: 55,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> , 80,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>, 150,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>, 200,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> , 100<span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Green voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>, 25<span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Blue voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>, 15 <span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Purple voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>, and 10<span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Golden voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>, and not be repeated\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\">Pedestal Decoration</span></h2>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Upgrade\n</th>\n<th>Level 1\n</th>\n<th>Level 2\n</th>\n<th>Level 3\n</th>\n<th>Level 4\n</th>\n<th>Level 5\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Description\n</td>\n<td>Select a pedestal style\n<p>and its color\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>Select first type of flower\n<p>and its color\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>Select a border around\n<p>flower bed and its color\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>Select second type of flower\n<p>and its color\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>Select the top element\n<p>to the pedestal\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>Classic\n<ul><li>White</li>\n<li>Bronze</li>\n<li>Gold</li>\n<li>Grey</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Daisies\n<ul><li>Pink</li>\n<li>White</li>\n<li>Orange</li>\n<li>Blue</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Stone\n<ul><li>Beige</li>\n<li>Brown</li>\n<li>Grey</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Daisies\n<ul><li>Pink</li>\n<li>White</li>\n<li>Orange</li>\n<li>Blue</li></ul>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>Vase\n<ul><li>Red</li>\n<li>Yellow</li>\n<li>Purple</li>\n<li>Pink</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>Floral\n<ul><li>Beige</li>\n<li>Yellow</li>\n<li>Pink</li>\n<li>Grey</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Pensies\n<ul><li>Purple</li>\n<li>Blue</li>\n<li>Yellow</li>\n<li>Red</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Floral\n<ul><li>White</li>\n<li>Green</li>\n<li>Golden</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Pensies\n<ul><li>Purple</li>\n<li>Blue</li>\n<li>Yellow</li>\n<li>Red</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Birdbath\n<ul><li>Blue</li>\n<li>Yellow</li>\n<li>Purple</li>\n<li>Pink</li></ul>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>Rustic\n<ul><li>Brown</li>\n<li>Grey</li>\n<li>White</li>\n<li>Gold</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Lilacs\n<ul><li>Blue</li>\n<li>White</li>\n<li>Purple</li>\n<li>Pink</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Metal\n<ul><li>Bronze</li>\n<li>Silver</li>\n<li>Gold</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Lilacs\n<ul><li>Blue</li>\n<li>White</li>\n<li>Purple</li>\n<li>Pink</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Monkey\n<ul><li>Gold</li>\n<li>Brown</li>\n<li>Grey</li>\n<li>Dark grey</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>Tulips\n<ul><li>Orange</li>\n<li>Red</li>\n<li>Purple</li>\n<li>White</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>Tulips\n<ul><li>Orange</li>\n<li>Red</li>\n<li>Purple</li>\n<li>White</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">Cost\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>2 <span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Blueprint.png/revision/latest?cb=20200428130230\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blueprint\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>3 <span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Blueprint.png/revision/latest?cb=20200428130230\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blueprint\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15,000<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\">Randomized in list: 55,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> , 80,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>, 150,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>, 100<span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Green voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> (or 25<span>Voucher</span><span title=