i>\n<li>Purple</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Clematis\n<ul><li>Yellow</li>\n<li>White</li>\n<li>Pink</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>Bamboo\n<ul><li>Yellow</li>\n<li>Purple</li>\n<li>Blue</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Stone\n<ul><li>White</li>\n<li>Grey</li>\n<li>Brown</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Metal\n<ul><li>Purple</li>\n<li>White</li>\n<li>Dark grey</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Curtains\n<ul><li>White</li>\n<li>Purple</li>\n<li>Pink</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Shrubs\n<ul><li>Green</li>\n<li>Orange</li>\n<li>Bright green</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Rose\n<ul><li>Yellow</li>\n<li>White</li>\n<li>Pink</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>Metal\n<ul><li>Pink</li>\n<li>Yellow</li>\n<li>Blue</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Wood\n<ul><li>Reddish</li>\n<li>Brown</li>\n<li>Turquoise</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Stone\n<ul><li>Brown</li>\n<li>White</li>\n<li>Gray</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Lights\n<ul><li>Yellow</li>\n<li>Purple</li>\n<li>Blue</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Stones\n<ul><li>White</li>\n<li>Grey</li>\n<li>Blue</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>Jasmine\n<ul><li>White</li>\n<li>Yellow</li>\n<li>Pink</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">Cost\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>3 <span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Blueprint.png/revision/latest?cb=20200428130230\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blueprint\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>5 <span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Blueprint.png/revision/latest?cb=20200428130230\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blueprint\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>7 <span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Blueprint.png/revision/latest?cb=20200428130230\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blueprint\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15,000<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\">Randomized in list: 85,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>, 150,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>, 250,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> ,100<span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Green voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>, 25<span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Blue voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>, 15 <span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Purple voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>, and 10<span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Golden voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> , and not be repeated\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ol><li>You need to pay some upgrades with coins or pair of numbers of vouchers.</li>\n<li>The each cost of almost completed decorations (except Pedestal decoration) is  500,000 coins, 100 green vouchers, 25 blue ones, 15 purple ones, 10 gold ones, and 15 blueprints.</li>\n<li>The each cost of upgrade is randomized. For example, you may pay level 2 upgrade of rustic style in Pedestal decoration with 55,000 coins, but you may pay level 2 upgrade of floral style in the same decoration with 25 blue vouchers and 15 purple ones.</li>\n<li>For Pedestal decoration, There are 442,368 different combination results which you can custom the decoration.</li>\n<li>For Yard decoration, There are 531,441 different combination results which you can custom the decoration.</li>\n<li>For Gardeners' decoration, There are 72,171 different combination results which you can custom the decoration.</li></ol>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901030644\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.099 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.104 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 393/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11866/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua tim